# inc-59lq: clear the arrival prompt and wait one turn (a run with no game time
# is reported as NO GAMEPLAY). The monsters this check
# watches are placed, and each one's ChooseAction run, by ConcentMonsterProbe
# (src/ConcentMonsterProbe.cpp) before the first key is read. Read by
# tools/check_concentration.sh.
SPACE SPACE
@dump:arrival
.
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:waited
